      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CROOK (3) talented mare who can tick off the 1200m box today from the good gate. Rocked late from the outside draw with an unlucky second over 1200m at Dubbo. Zoe Hunt keeps the ride and ready to win from the low draw. CRUSADER KINGS (1) is a distance specialist who is set to peak at his fourth run back. Slick win first up and has since raced in tougher company. Snagged back from the gate and struck plenty of traffic in the straight with a plugging fourth over 1100m at Dubbo. Has the talent to finish over the top of these. POISEN POINT (4) raced with distinction in town and resumes with a good fresh record. Dropped in trip and got out of her ground when she raced flat for a dismal twelfth over 1400m in the Country Cup at Scone last May. Top three contender. BRIGHELLA (6) chasing his third straight victory but yet to win past 1000m. Brings the right form to the table and must be kept safe. NIGHT FIGHTER (2) undefeated at this track and returned to form with a game win last start.",
